msgstr "Esborra la clau d'API emmagatzemada"

#: admin.py:168
msgid ""
"A key is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new key to "
"replace it. The stored value cannot be viewed."
msgstr ""
"La clau s'emmagatzema xifrada. Deixeu-la en blanc per conservar-la, o "
"introduïu una clau nova per substituir-la. El valor emmagatzemat no es pot "
"visualitzar."

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"S'introdueix una vegada, s'emmagatzema xifrada i no es pot tornar a "
"visualitzar. Deixeu-la buida per usar OPENROUTER_API_KEY / "
"settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."

#: admin.py:216
msgid "API key status"
msgstr "Estat de la clau d'API"

